SUMMARY:The Rosicrucian Way of Life II
DESCRIPTION:Rosicrucians AMORC\, Santa Rosa\, CA\nThe January 1982 issue o
 f the *Rosicrucian Digest* included an article by Past Grand Master Robert
  E. Daniels entitled “The Celestial Sanctum: The Rosicrucian Way of Life
 .” We will follow up again on that article which puts our purpose in liv
 ing and the process and way of our full maturation into a comprehensive an
 d overarching perspective. Join Hugh McCague as we continue to explore Ros
 icrucian laws and principles and their creative expression and application
  for the mastery of life\, harmonious living\, and service.\n\n**Please RS
 VP to access log-in information. Click ATTEND ONLINE below.**
