DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260620T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260620T123000
SUMMARY:Summer Symposium: Self Mastery - Inner Alchemy for Everyday Life
DESCRIPTION:Rosicrucians AMORC\, Santa Rosa\, CA\nJoin us for our Summer S
 ymposium where we will be focusing on Self Mastery: Inner Alchemy for Ever
 yday Life.\n\nThis inspiring series of presentations will explore the time
 less art of self-mastery through the lens of Rosicrucian wisdom\, alchemy\
 , creativity\, and healing. Discover practical methods for transforming yo
 ur thoughts\, emotions\, and actions\; learn how consciousness shapes your
  experience of reality\; explore the mystical and healing properties of mo
 rning dew as a symbol of inner renewal\; and uncover the power of creativi
 ty as a tool for personal growth and spiritual development. Together\, the
 se presentations offer meaningful insights and practical techniques to hel
 p you accelerate your journey toward greater Self-Awareness\, Inner Harmon
 y\, and Mastery of Life.\n\n**Free admission - Open to the Public. Please 
 RSVP to access log-in information. Click ATTEND ONLINE below.**\n\n**Here 
 is the schedule:**\n\n**10:00 am PDT**\n**Summer Solstice Attunement with 
 Grand Master Julie Scott**\nJoin Grand Master Julie Scott for a special ce
 lebration of the Summer Solstice\, the longest day of the year and the off
 icial beginning of summer in the Northern Hemisphere. This presentation ho
 nors the moment when Earth is most fully aligned with the Sun’s radiant 
 energy and will feature a guided meditation designed to deepen our connect
 ion with the Sun and the cosmic essence it continually radiates. We will a
 lso explore and attune with the pineal center—the psychic center believe
 d to assimilate the greatest quantity of cosmic essence—opening the door
  to greater spiritual awareness\, inner illumination\, and personal renewa
 l.\n\n**10:30 am PDT**\n**The Alchemical Process Leading to the Mastery of
  Life** **with Julian Johnson**\nEveryday life is the arena in which we pu
 rsue the inner transformation that helps us to increasingly manifest the h
 igher mind that resides within us. Self-consciousness and free will afford
  us the opportunity to actively participate in this transformation. In kee
 ping with the alchemical symbols of earth\, air\, water and fire\, we can 
 transform our physical\, mental and emotional selves through the employmen
 t of our will to become a fuller expression of the Infinite Intelligence w
 hich is the core of our being. During this symposium\, we will explore pra
 ctical tools that can be used in our daily lives to accelerate our progres
 s on this alchemical journey and to reap the benefits of Self-Mastery and 
 the Mastery of Life.\n\n**11:00 am PDT**\n**Transform Your Reality with Le
 o Adams**\nThe art of self-mastery begins with the ability to consciously 
 shape and embody your own reality from within\, while influencing the expe
 riences and circumstances that unfold around you. Life is not accidental\;
  it is both an individual journey and a shared human experience. Through i
 nner alchemy and the continuous transformation of consciousness\, thought\
 , word\, and action\, you possess the power to create and redefine your re
 ality. Though the world presents countless external actualities\, the real
 ity you live and embody ultimately belongs to you alone. Transform your co
 nsciousness! Live your reality!\n\n**11:30 am PDT**\n**Dimensions of Dew w
 ith Cheri Gandy**\nIn this presentation\, we will examine how one of the a
 lchemical wonders of the natural world\, morning dew\, can be harnessed fo
 r our own inner development and healing. We will look at dew through the t
 riple lens of ancient Egyptian thought\; the theology and natural healing 
 work of Hildegard of Bingen\; and that of Rosicrucian healing. Our journey
  into this divine substance will help us connect with the depth and many d
 imensions of our inner and outer worlds.\n\n**12:00 pm PDT**\n**The Art of
  Self-Creation with Josh Green**\nThe Rosicrucian Order promotes the *mast
 ery of life\,* an active approach to facing life's challenges. This active
  approach to life uses our latent creativity and imagination to respond to
  life with greater flexibility and decision space. In this class\, artist 
 Josh Green will share practical uses of creativity to deal with and overco
 me the challenges of daily life. Using the symbolism of the Sun and the su
 mmer solstice\, we will explore the mind and how to actively apply our cre
 ativity to shaping our thoughts\, words\, and actions as a means of crafti
 ng the self toward the spiritual ideal.\n\nEveryone is welcome!\n\n**Pleas
 e RSVP to access log-in information. Click ATTEND ONLINE below.**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/amorc-santa-rosa-pronaos/events/31529
 1801/
